1 Overview
**********

‘bocl’ runs an interactive read-eval-print loop, and can load files and
evaluate forms given on the command line before optionally entering the
REPL. On start-up it loads its system Lisp files -- the prelude and its
supporting files (‘cl-exports.lisp’, ‘bignum.lisp’,
‘bignum-integration.lisp’).


