3 Files
*******

The default install prefix is ‘/opt/local’.

‘PREFIX/bin/bocl’
     The executable.
‘PREFIX/libexec/bocl/’
     The system Lisp files loaded at start-up: ‘prelude.lisp’,
     ‘cl-exports.lisp’, ‘bignum.lisp’, ‘bignum-integration.lisp’.
‘PREFIX/lib/libbocl.*’
     The runtime library (static and shared) for embedding bocl in a C
     program.
‘PREFIX/include/bocl/’
     The C headers for embedding.
‘~/.boclrc’
     Per-user init file (unless ‘--no-init’).

   The environment variable ‘BOCL_PRELUDE’, if set to a readable path,
overrides the prelude search.


